<title>NETHERLANDS: DOCdata starts trading at NLG 25.50.</title>
<headline>DOCdata starts trading at NLG 25.50.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Dutch compact disc maker DOCdata NV started trading on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange at 25.50 guilders, the bourse said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Earlier DOCdata said that its global offering has been priced at 25.25 guilders ($13.00) per ordinary share.</p>
<p>Of the five million ordinary shares to be sold in the offering, three million ordinary shares were sold by the company, raising proceeds (excluding expenses) of 70 million guilders. The remaining two million ordinary shares are being offered by current shareholders of DOCdata.</p>
<p>DOCdata's shares will also be quoted on NASDAQ.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
